  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  nameMiniGameList:
  - Shark Hungry
  - Color Survival
  - Laser And Fire
  - Pirate King's Gaze
  - Tile Wars
  - Four dead
  - IsLand Cannon
  instructTextList:
  - Use movement keys and quick reflexes to dodge shark attacks.
  - Stand on the platform that matches the target color before time runs out, or
    you will fall when the wrong platforms collapse.
  - Stand on the platform that matches the target color before time runs out, or
    you will fall when the wrong platforms collapse.
  - Move while the Pirate King is looking away. Stop immediately when he turns around.
    If he catches you moving, you lose!
  - 'Move across tiles to claim them for your color. Collect Shadows to grow larger
    and gain an advantage. Own the most tiles before time runs out to win! '
  - "A bomb will be randomly given to one player\u2014move close to your opponent
    to pass it, but after each pass there is a short cooldown."
  - "A bomb will be randomly given to one player\u2014move close to your opponent
    to pass it, but after each pass there is a short cooldown."
  errorTextList:
  - "The shark\u2019s hunting speed will gradually increase with each wave!"
  - Wrong platforms will collapse!
  - Wrong platforms will collapse!
  - Be careful! He can turn around at any time
  - Color Wipe removes colors from nearby tiles. Freeze temporarily stops your movement!
  - The bomb explodes when the countdown reaches 4 seconds, and whoever is holding
    it will be eliminated.
  - The bomb explodes when the countdown reaches 4 seconds, and whoever is holding
    it will be eliminated.
